WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.570
I could talk about cookbooks all day.

2
00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.059
Usually, I do actually.

3
00:00:05.059 --> 00:00:05.892
(background giggles)

4
00:00:05.892 --> 00:00:08.480
And that's why we created Cookbook Club.

5
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.070
And so far we've curated a roster of recommendations

6
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.820
from celebrity chefs, friends, people of note.

7
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.810
And now it's time for you to get involved.

8
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.280
That's actually why Pilar and I wanted

9
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.040
to create Cookbook club in the first place.

10
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:24.873
That's right.

11
00:00:24.873 --> 00:00:27.620
This is Pilar Valdes, friend of the show.

12
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:28.560
(audience applauding and cheering)

13
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.370
Chef Pilar Valdez.

14
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:31.970
Yeah

15
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:35.660
And so we're gonna be joined by some VFF's today.

16
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.563
I'm really excited.

17
00:00:38.574 --> 00:00:40.011
(Pilar laughing)

18
00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:41.640
So without further ado, Pilar please tell us

19
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.460
what our Cookbook Club pick is today.

20
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:48.150
The "Essentials of Italian Classic Cooking"

21
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:52.150
by one of my culinary heroes, Marcella Hazan.

22
00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.374
She is such, such a tremendous pioneer.

23
00:00:55.374 --> 00:00:58.480
And I really think she taught people how

24
00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.590
to approach Italian food in a whole different way.

25
00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.680
And there were a few fundamentals

26
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.003 line:15%
also that she really sort of drove home.

27
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:09.860 line:15%
She emphasized the importance

28
00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.560 line:15%
of how to source really great ingredients

29
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.050
and then said at the end of the day

30
00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:17.250
it all boils down to your palette, to your taste.

31
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.720
So learn and taste as you go.

32
00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:22.790 line:15%
Right, you know, that is something

33
00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:25.760 line:15%
that I think you have to really remember to do.

34
00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:26.610 line:15%
Absolutely.

35
00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:29.050 line:15%
Okay, well, I wanna bring in our VFFs.

36
00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.180 line:15%
I'm so excited.

37
00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:33.582
Everybody, please welcome Lynn, Daniel, and Zenobia.

38
00:01:33.582 --> 00:01:35.309
(crowd clapping)

39
00:01:35.309 --> 00:01:36.142
Hi!

40
00:01:36.142 --> 00:01:37.270
Oh my God look how many of us are here

41
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:38.749
I know

42
00:01:38.749 --> 00:01:39.785
It's a real party.

43
00:01:39.785 --> 00:01:41.901
Hi, Lynn, how are you?

44
00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.440
I'm so good.

45
00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:46.040
Thank you for having me as part of this cookbook club.

46
00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.840
Well, how come you want it to be a part of it?

47
00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:48.863
May I ask?

48
00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:52.270
So I'm a busy mom of triplets

49
00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.070 line:15%
