55
00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.740
Well, nothing better than Italian.

56
00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:11.580
Okay. Daniel, I'm so glad you're here.

57
00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.440
Hello!

58
00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.130
Hello. I'm so happy to be here.

59
00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.480
Thanks so much for having me.

60
00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.664
Us too.

61
00:02:16.664 --> 00:02:18.910
Why were you interested in Cookbook Club?

62
00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:21.240
Well, cooking is my favorite hobby

63
00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.930 line:15%
and I have a collection of cookbooks.

64
00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:25.890 line:15%
I've always been drawn to cookbooks.

65
00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:28.218 line:15%
When I was a kid in elementary school

66
00:02:28.218 --> 00:02:31.390
I would read the joy of cooking.

67
00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:32.790
You were just talking like reading in bed.

68
00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.517
I would read the joy of cooking in bed.

69
00:02:34.517 --> 00:02:37.820 line:15%
And I would think about recipes that I wanted to make.

70
00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:39.570 line:15%
And then the next day I would get up

71
00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.700 line:15%
