72
00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.018 line:15%
And so I would stay home from school

73
00:02:43.018 --> 00:02:44.450 line:15%
(laughter)

74
00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.480 line:15%
and everyone else will leave the house

75
00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.430 line:15%
and I would spend the entire day cooking.

76
00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:50.469
And I did this several times.

77
00:02:50.469 --> 00:02:52.246
So yeah.

78
00:02:52.246 --> 00:02:53.079
(laughing)

79
00:02:53.079 --> 00:02:55.040
Well that might be one of the most G-rated hooky

80
00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.947
reasons I've ever heard of.

81
00:02:56.947 --> 00:02:57.908
(laughing)

82
00:02:57.908 --> 00:03:00.060
