83
00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.493
Now, Zenobia!

84
00:03:04.345 --> 00:03:05.178
Hi Drew.

85
00:03:05.178 --> 00:03:06.790
Have you recovered from the sushi

86
00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.560
