87
00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.077
Yes I have, Oh my God.

88
00:03:13.018 --> 00:03:14.000
(laughs)

89
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.419
We did never have I ever

90
00:03:15.419 --> 00:03:19.169
and we made her eat her first sushi.

91
00:03:19.169 --> 00:03:20.670
Zenobia props to you.

92
00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.556
Yeah she spat it right out!

93
00:03:22.556 --> 00:03:23.440
(Laughing)

94
00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.020
I love it, you were so fun.

95
00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.120
I'm so glad you're back.

96
00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.570
May I ask, what interests you about cookbook club?

97
00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.840
First of all, I am so happy to be back with you Drew.

98
00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.390 line:15%
And I just want to say that, you know, you got me

99
00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.260 line:15%
