100
00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.093 line:15%
your blouses.

101
00:03:38.093 --> 00:03:40.170 line:15%
So I said, let me step up my game today

102
00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.718
with Drew with her blouse.

103
00:03:41.718 --> 00:03:44.713
Thank you, Ladies and Gentlemen.

104
00:03:45.599 --> 00:03:49.560
Alright, Lynn, what did you make

105
00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:53.516
