108
00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.770
With tomatoes, oregano and hot pepper.

109
00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:04.240
And that was really, really good too.

110
00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.570
The fish I'd never cooked with that type of fish before.

111
00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:09.160
And it had like a buttery nutty flavor

112
00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.480
