113
00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.950
And it was still delicious.

114
00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.490 line:15%
My kids loved it.

115
00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:15.250 line:15%
The table section in the back

116
00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.550
