119
00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.460
And I loved her book.

120
00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.700
It's amazing.

121
00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.148
You look really proud.

122
00:04:28.148 --> 00:04:29.797
