126
00:04:35.398 --> 00:04:37.459
I hope you felt good about that.

127
00:04:37.459 --> 00:04:39.060
I was really happy.

128
00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:41.610
Daniel, what did you read,

129
00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.177
