143
00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:13.859 line:15%
No way.

144
00:05:13.859 --> 00:05:14.772 line:15%
(laughing)

145
00:05:14.772 --> 00:05:15.912 line:15%
That's so cool.

146
00:05:15.912 --> 00:05:16.745 line:15%
That's awesome.

147
00:05:16.745 --> 00:05:19.510 line:15%
