149
00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:25.354
It was incredible, I will make that again.

150
00:05:25.354 --> 00:05:27.435
And Zenobia, What did you make?

151
00:05:27.435 --> 00:05:32.435
I made the pork glazed with tomato and sage

152
00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.662
and I definitely stepped up my pork chop.

153
00:05:36.662 --> 00:05:37.700
[] Awesome.

154
00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.660
My family absolutely loved it.

155
00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.680
I'm glad it really worked out for you.

156
00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:42.520
